      "documentation-only classification maps only to documentation/governance-light families",
      "CI_WORKFLOW maps to workflow syntax/security families",
      "CONTRACT_SCHEMA maps to schema/contract families",
      "BUSINESS_PRODUCTION maps to production unit/static families",
      "RISK_EXECUTION_CRITICAL maps to risk/execution critical families",
      "UNKNOWN_REQUIRES_REVIEW maps to conservative manual/deep-impact sentinel",
      "mixed labels return the union of all required impact families"
    ]
  },
